---
interface Props {
  email?: string;
}

const { email = "agusllama1@gmail.com" } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="soluciones" class="w-full py-14 sm:py-20 md:py-24 bg-apple-bg relative">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <!-- Section Header (Apple Keynote Style) -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-black/[0.08] text-apple-text-secondary text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3.5 shadow-xs">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary"></span>
        <span>KEYNOTE DE SOLUCIONES & CAPACIDADES</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight mt-1 mb-3 text-balance">
        Herramientas digitales diseñadas para hacer crecer tu negocio.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-pretty">
        Cada módulo resuelve un cuello de botella comercial concreto: automatización de ventas, eliminación de tareas manuales y velocidad sin fricción.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Master Bento Grid (Inspirado en Apple Keynote Slide) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
      
      <!-- CARD 1: E-Commerce B2B / Mayorista (Col-span 2) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="bento-tag-indigo">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z" />
              </svg>
              E-Commerce & B2B
            </span>
            <span class="bento-tag-success">
              +30% Ventas Digitales
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight mb-2">
            Tiendas Online & Ventas Mayoristas
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Plataformas de venta rápida con reglas de precios mayoristas por volumen, catálogo autoadministrable y pasarelas de pago integradas sin comisiones abusivas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Embedded Mini Store Widget (Apple Style Interactive Preview) -->
        <div class="bg-[#F8F9FB] border border-black/[0.05] rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5 mb-2 shadow-inner">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-black/[0.05] mb-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0">
                📦
              </div>
              <div>
                <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-apple-text-primary leading-tight">Caja Mayorista (50 uds.)</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-apple-text-secondary">Precio unitario: $1.200</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              10+ u: -15%
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-black/[0.08] shadow-xs">
              <span class="text-apple-text-secondary font-bold">Cant:</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-apple-text-primary">12</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <span class="block text-[10px] uppercase text-apple-text-secondary font-medium">Total con descuento</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-apple-text-primary">$12.240</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-apple-text-tertiary pt-2">
          <span>✓ Pagos con Mercado Pago, tarjetas y transferencia</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-brand-primary group-hover:underline">Ver caso ➔</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 2: Sistema de Turnos & Agenda (Tall / Col-span 1 o Row-span 2) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 lg:row-span-2 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
            <span class="bento-tag-yellow">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              Gestión & Turnos
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight mb-2">
            Agenda & Turnos Online
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Tus clientes reservan y pagan seña en 3 pasos sin que tengas que coordinar mensajes manuales uno por uno.
          </p>

          <!-- Embedded Calendar & Slot Widget (Inspirado en StandBy / Calendar de Apple) -->
          <div class="bg-[#1C1C1E] text-white rounded-2xl p-4 mb-4 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 text-xs">
              <span class="font-bold text-white/90">OCTUBRE 2026</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 text-[10px] font-semibold bg-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">● En vivo</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Mini Time Slot Selector -->
            <div class="space-y-1.5 mb-3 text-xs">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
                <span class="font-medium text-white/80">09:30 hs</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-300 font-bold">Disponible</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary text-white flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-bold shadow-xs">
                <span>11:15 hs</span>
                <span class="text-white/90">Seleccionado ✓</span>
              </div>
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-white/40 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px]">
                <span class="line-through">15:00 hs</span>
                <span class="text-[10px]">Reservado</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Auto Notification Preview -->
            <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/10 text-[10px] text-white/70 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 shrink-0">💬</span>
              <span class="truncate">WhatsApp automático de recordatorio</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-black/[0.05]">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <div>
              <span class="text-base font-extrabold text-apple-text-primary leading-none">15 hs / sem</span>
              <span class="block text-[10px] text-apple-text-secondary">Ahorradas en gestión</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-primary group-hover:underline">Conocer más ➔</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 3: Trato 1 a 1 Directo (Inspirado en el badge circular Check In de Apple) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 flex flex-col justify-between items-center text-center group">
        <div class="w-full flex justify-end">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-apple-text-tertiary uppercase tracking-wider">GARANTÍA</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Apple Check In Tribute Badge -->
        <div class="my-3 flex flex-col items-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-18 sm:h-18 rounded-full bg-[#FACC15] text-[#1D1D1F] flex items-center justify-center font-black shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(250,204,21,0.35)] mb-3 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
            <svg class="w-9 h-9 stroke-[3]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight">
            Trato 1 a 1
          </h3>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-apple-text-secondary mt-0.5">
            Sin intermediarios
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-pretty">
          Hablas directo con quien diseña y programa tu sistema. Cero teléfonos descompuestos ni demoras.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 4: SLA < 24 Hs (Apple Dynamic Island Status Style) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="bento-tag text-[10px]">SLA COMERCIAL</span>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
                <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
                <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-600">Activo</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="my-2">
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight block">
              &lt; 24 hs
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-text-secondary uppercase tracking-wider block mt-1">
              Tiempo de Respuesta
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-2 text-pretty">
            Comunicación continua y soporte técnico ágil durante todo el desarrollo y luego de la entrega.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-3 border-t border-black/[0.05] flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-apple-text-secondary font-medium">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-apple-green shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
          </svg>
          <span>Compromiso contractual</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 5: Velocidad Extrema 100/100 (Inspirado en Apple 48MP / Performance Gauge) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="bento-tag text-[10px]">GOOGLE LIGHTHOUSE</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-green">Extremo</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Circular Progress Meter 100/100 -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 my-2">
            <div class="relative w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-16 h-16 -rotate-90" viewBox="0 0 36 36">
                <path
                  class="text-black/[0.06]"
                  stroke-width="3.5"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  fill="none"
                  d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"
                />
                <path
                  class="text-apple-green"
                  stroke-dasharray="100, 100"
                  stroke-width="3.5"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  fill="none"
                  d="M18 2.0845 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 31.831 a 15.9155 15.9155 0 0 1 0 -31.831"
                />
              </svg>
              <span class="absolute font-extrabold text-sm text-apple-text-primary">100</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="block text-sm font-bold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight">Carga Ultrarrápida</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-apple-text-secondary leading-tight block">&lt; 0.8 seg en 4G</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed mt-1 text-pretty">
            Cada segundo extra de lentitud pierde un 20% de compradores. Tu web cargará al instante.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4 Micro Indicators -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5 pt-3 border-t border-black/[0.05] text-[10px] text-apple-text-secondary font-medium">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <span class="text-apple-green font-bold">●</span> Rendimiento: 100
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <span class="text-apple-green font-bold">●</span> SEO: 100
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 6: Código 100% Tuyo (Apple Titanium / Autonomy Card) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-1 lg:col-span-1 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="bento-tag text-[10px]">AUTONOMÍA TOTAL</span>
            <span class="text-base">🔓</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight mb-2">
            100% Tuyo
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-pretty">
            Sin suscripciones cautivas ni código secuestrado. El dominio, los accesos, la base de datos y los archivos quedan a tu nombre para siempre.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-1.5 pt-3 border-t border-black/[0.05] text-[11px] text-apple-text-secondary">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-apple-green shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Sin mensualidades cautivas</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-apple-green shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span>Código exportable y limpio</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 7: Metodología Llave en Mano en 3 Pasos (Col-span 2) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="bento-tag-indigo">
              MÉTODO DE TRABAJO
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-apple-text-tertiary">3 Fases Claras</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight mb-2">
            Proceso de Desarrollo Transparente
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Sabrás exactamente qué se está construyendo y cuándo estará listo, sin sorpresas de presupuesto.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Visual 3-Step Pipeline -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-2">
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05]">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-primary text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-2 shadow-xs">
              1
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-text-primary">Diagnóstico</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-text-secondary mt-0.5 leading-normal">
              Definición de requerimientos y cotización formal fija.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05]">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-primary text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-2 shadow-xs">
              2
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-text-primary">Desarrollo Vivo</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-text-secondary mt-0.5 leading-normal">
              Avances con enlace privado para probarlo en funcionamiento real.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05]">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-apple-green text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center mb-2 shadow-xs">
              3
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-apple-text-primary">Lanzamiento</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-apple-text-secondary mt-0.5 leading-normal">
              Publicación en tu dominio y capacitación práctica para administrarlo.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-apple-text-tertiary pt-2">
          <span>✓ Sin tecnicismos confusos</span>
          <a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Consulta%20sobre%20metodolog%C3%ADa`} class="font-semibold text-brand-primary hover:underline">
            Consultar plazos para tu proyecto ➔
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CARD 8: Stack Tecnológico de Alto Desempeño (Squircle App Icons Tribute) -->
      <div class="bento-card p-6 sm:p-7 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <span class="bento-tag">
              ARQUITECTURA
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-apple-text-tertiary">Modern Stack</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-apple-text-primary tracking-tight mb-2">
            Tecnología Moderna de Alto Rendimiento
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-apple-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Herramientas robustas utilizadas por las empresas tecnológicas líderes, dejando atrás plantillas pesadas de WordPress propensas a romperse con actualizaciones.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Squircle App Icons Row (Apple Style) -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05] hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xs transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-xs">
              🚀
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-apple-text-primary">Astro</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05] hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xs transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-xs">
              ⚛️
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-apple-text-primary">React</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05] hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xs transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-green-500/10 text-green-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-xs">
              🟢
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-apple-text-primary">Node.js</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05] hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xs transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-xs">
              🎨
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-apple-text-primary">Tailwind</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#F8F9FA] border border-black/[0.05] hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xs transition-all">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shadow-xs">
              🗄️
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-apple-text-primary">SQL</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-apple-text-tertiary pt-2">
          <span>✓ Seguridad, escalabilidad y mantenimiento cero fricción</span>
          <span class="font-medium text-apple-text-secondary">Despliegue Cloud</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
